%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8075f72503cc02c8098479e6a2cc8e98, type: 3}
  m_Name: GearSetDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Aethvirse::Aethvirse.Items.GearSetDatabase
  sets:
  - id: ashwalker
    displayName: Ashwalker
    lore: Worn by the scouts who went into the dead city first and came back last.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: atk%
      value: 0.05
      text: ATK +5%
    - pieces: 4
      stat: lifesteal
      value: 0.03
      text: Heal 3% of damage dealt
    - pieces: 6
      stat: atk%
      value: 0.12
      text: ATK +12% more
  - id: verdant_oath
    displayName: Verdant Oath
    lore: Sworn to a valley that never asked for protecting. It was grateful anyway.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: hp%
      value: 0.08
      text: HP +8%
    - pieces: 4
      stat: def%
      value: 0.1
      text: DEF +10%
    - pieces: 6
      stat: hp%
      value: 0.2
      text: HP +20% more
  - id: dunestrider
    displayName: Dunestrider
    lore: Couriers of the Crimson Dunes ran these routes for three hundred years
      without being caught.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: mspd
      value: 0.08
      text: Move speed +8%
    - pieces: 4
      stat: aspd
      value: 0.1
      text: Attack speed +10%
    - pieces: 6
      stat: crit
      value: 0.08
      text: Critical chance +8%
  - id: frostveil_regalia
    displayName: Frostveil Regalia
    lore: Court dress of the ice-mages, who froze their own hall rather than surrender
      it.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: cdr
      value: 0.05
      text: "Cooldowns \u22125%"
    - pieces: 4
      stat: atk%
      value: 0.1
      text: ATK +10%
    - pieces: 6
      stat: cdr
      value: 0.12
      text: "Cooldowns \u221212% more"
  - id: drowned_archivist
    displayName: Drowned Archivist
    lore: The archivists stayed with their books when the tide came. Their gear still
      smells of ink and salt.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: crit
      value: 0.05
      text: Critical chance +5%
    - pieces: 4
      stat: critdmg
      value: 0.25
      text: Critical damage +25%
    - pieces: 6
      stat: crit
      value: 0.1
      text: Critical chance +10% more
  - id: fracture_knight
    displayName: Fracture Knight
    lore: Knights who stood on the edge when the world split, and did not step back.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: def%
      value: 0.12
      text: DEF +12%
    - pieces: 4
      stat: atk%
      value: 0.12
      text: ATK +12%
    - pieces: 6
      stat: hp%
      value: 0.25
      text: HP +25%
  - id: hollow_regent
    displayName: Hollow Regent
    lore: Regalia made for a ruler who never came. It fits you suspiciously well.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: atk%
      value: 0.1
      text: ATK +10%
    - pieces: 4
      stat: lifesteal
      value: 0.05
      text: Heal 5% of damage dealt
    - pieces: 6
      stat: atk%
      value: 0.25
      text: ATK +25% more
  - id: first_vanguard
    displayName: Echo of the First Vanguard
    lore: Someone carried the Codex before you. This is what is left of them. It
      remembers how to fight.
    tiers:
    - pieces: 2
      stat: atk%
      value: 0.15
      text: ATK +15%
    - pieces: 4
      stat: cdr
      value: 0.15
      text: "Cooldowns \u221215%"
    - pieces: 6
      stat: critdmg
      value: 0.6
      text: Critical damage +60%
